<script setup lang="ts">import type {InputUncertainty} from '../types/domain';import Notice from './common/Notice.vue';import {number,percent} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{data:InputUncertainty}>();
</script><template><section class="paper"><div class="section-heading"><h2>输入不确定性 · 整条重抽预演</h2><span>{{data.groups}}组 × 每组{{data.replications_per_group}}次预演 · 每组n={{data.sample_size}} · seed {{data.seed}}</span></div><Notice v-if="data.stable&&data.overload.groups>0">{{data.overload.groups}}个重抽组ρ≥1（占比{{percent(data.overload.fraction)}}），已单列，不并入稳定组等待区间。</Notice><Notice v-if="!data.stable" error>全部{{data.groups}}个重抽组ρ≥1：没有稳定组等待区间，过载占比100%。各组估计率与有限期暂态等待见下表。</Notice><div class="result-metrics"><div><small>重抽组数</small><b>{{data.groups}}</b><em>按剖面时段整条有放回重抽</em></div><div v-if="data.stable" class="featured"><small>稳定组输入不确定95%区间</small><b class="range">{{number(data.stable.wait_ci95[0])}}—{{number(data.stable.wait_ci95[1])}}</b><em>分钟 · {{data.stable.groups}}个稳定组 · 正态近似</em></div><div v-else><small>稳定组等待区间</small><b>无稳定组</b><em>全部重抽组ρ≥1</em></div><div><small>过载组占比</small><b>{{percent(data.overload.fraction)}}</b><em>{{data.overload.groups}}/{{data.groups}}组 ρ≥1 · 单列</em></div><div v-if="data.stable"><small>样本差异 / 预演波动</small><b class="range">{{number(data.stable.input_sd)}} / {{number(data.stable.within_group_sd)}}</b><em>分钟 · 标准差分量</em></div><div v-else><small>样本差异 / 预演波动</small><b>—</b><em>无稳定组可分解</em></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>重抽组</th><th>样本核对</th><th>估计λ / μ</th><th>负荷ρ</th><th>状态</th><th>组内平均等待</th><th>组内95%区间</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="g in data.groups_detail" :key="g.group" :class="{'overload-row':!g.stable}"><td><b>#{{g.group}}</b><small>{{g.sample_preview.join(' ')}} …</small></td><td><small class="checksum">{{g.sample_checksum.slice(0,16)}}…</small><small>n={{g.n}} 与剖面页同口径</small></td><td>{{number(g.arrival_rate,3)}} / {{number(g.service_rate,3)}}</td><td>{{percent(g.rho)}}</td><td><span :class="['stability',{unstable:!g.stable}]">{{g.stable?'稳定':'过载·暂态'}}</span></td><td>{{number(g.mean_wait_minutes)}} 分钟</td><td>{{number(g.wait_ci95[0])}}—{{number(g.wait_ci95[1])}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><small class="method-note">λ/μ为重抽样本估计值（未含方案倍率）；ρ已含倍率与窗口数。{{data.method}}</small></section></template>
